div(style='font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto; color: #111827;')
  h2(style='margin-bottom: 12px;') Verify your email
  p Hello #{fullName},
  p Your OTP for Mini OTT verification is:
  p(style='font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 4px; margin: 16px 0;') #{otp}
  p This OTP expires in #{expiryMinutes} minutes.
  p If you did not request this, you can ignore this email.
